  "shownIn": "weather",
  "text": "Thus did I by the Water’s brink<br>Another World beneath me think;<br>And while the lofty spacious Skies<br>Reversed there abus’d mine Eys,<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;I fancy’d other Feet<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Came mine to touch or meet;<br>As by som Puddle I did play<br>Another World within it lay.",
  "citation": {
